age your Reward Tickets Online! </h2>\n\n    <div class=\"div-top-marg\">\n       Now, you can modify or cancel your trip effortlessly through Saudia app or website. \n    </div>\n\n  </div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n\n<div class=\"button-align\" dir=\"ltr\">\n  <a class=\"ndcbutton\" href=\"https://www.saudia.com/loyalty/manage-reward-ticket-form\" aria-label=\"Modify or Cancel Flight \">\n    Modify or Cancel Flight \n  </a>\n</div>\n</p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\"><!-- ENGLISH VERSION ONLY - Fully Responsive -->\n\n<div class=\"features-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"feature-card\">\n<div class=\"feature-header\">\n<h2 class=\"feature-title-inline\">How to Modify your Reward Ticket</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"step-list\">\n<div class=\"step-item\">\n<div class=\"step-number\">1</div>\n<div class=\"step-text\">Open Saudia app or website</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"step-item\">\n<div class=\"step-number\">2</div>\n<div class=\"step-text\">Go to \"Trips\" and click \"Modify trip\".</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"step-item\">\n<div class=\"step-number\">3</div>\n<div class=\"step-text\">Search for the new trip and confirm.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"step-item\">\n<div class=\"step-number\">4</div>\n<div class=\"step-text\">Confirm and pay any remaining balance. </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!---\n<div class=\"video-box\">\n<iframe src=\"https://youtu.be/MRxfeY8QswQ?si=YhdY9pKYl1I38rJS\"></iframe>\n</div>\n--->\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"feature-card\">\n<div class=\"feature-header\">\n<h2 class=\"feature-title-inline\">How to Cancel and Refund your Reward Ticket</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"step-list\">\n<div class=\"step-item\">\n<div class=\"step-number\">1</div>\n<div class=\"step-text\">Go to \"Trips\" and click \"Cancel trip\". </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"step-item\">\n<div class=\"step-number\">2</div>\n<div class=\"step-text\">Review your details. </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"step-item\">\n<div class=\"step-number\">3</div>\n<div class=\"step-text\">Confirm the request.</div>\n</div>\n\n<!---\n</div>\n<div class=\"video-box\">\n<iframe src=\"https://youtu.be/MRxfeY8QswQ?si=YhdY9pKYl1I38rJS\"></iframe>\n</div>\n--->\n\n</div>\n</div></div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"